[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0087","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18536","title":"WordPress stop-user-enumeration插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Stop User Enumeration 插件（版本 1.3.7 及更早）存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该插件用于阻止用户枚举攻击，但在处理 `author` 参数时未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标站点发送特制的 URL（如 `/?author=1<script>alert(1)</script>`），诱使受害者点击后，在受害者浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 或 HTML 代码。成功利用可导致会话劫持、钓鱼攻击、网站篡改等危害。攻击无需认证，仅需用户交互（点击链接）。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。厂商已在 1.3.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18536"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-21T12:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:03Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress stop-user-enumeration 插件至 1.3.8 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台，进入「插件」→「已安装插件」，找到 Stop User Enumeration 并点击「更新」。如已无法自动更新，请从 WordPress 插件目录重新下载安装。该版本修复了未授权用户枚举及跨站脚本漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/stop-user-enumeration/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18536.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18536.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18536.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18536.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18536-2995.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18536-2993.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-18536.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2017-18536.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/