,"cve_id":"CVE-2017-18528","title":"WordPress pdf-print插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 PDF & Print 插件（由 BestWebSoft 开发）1.9.4 之前版本存在跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79）。该漏洞源于插件对 admin.php 页面中 category 参数过滤不严，经过身份认证的攻击者可在参数中注入恶意 JavaScript 脚本，当管理员访问受影响页面时脚本即被执行，导致攻击者能够窃取会话 Cookie、执行恶意操作或篡改页面内容。攻击者需拥有 WordPress 后台登录权限，且需诱使用户访问特制链接方可触发，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18528"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-20T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:02Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress pdf-print 插件至 1.9.4 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台插件页面搜索 pdf-print 并点击更新，或手动从 WordPress 插件目录下载最新版覆盖安装。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用该插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/pdf-print/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18528.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18528.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18528.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18528.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18528.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18528.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2017-18528.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18528-pdf_print-9d272148-0c05-49c7-ab86-22a3bc622bcf.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18528.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18528.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18528.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0082","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18527","title":"WordPress Pagination插件 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Pagination by BestWebSoft 插件 1.0.7 之前版本存在跨站脚本漏洞（XSS），该插件在后台管理页面的 category 参数中未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理，导致认证后的攻击者（如订阅者或贡献者角色）可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 并诱导管理员点击，从而在目标浏览器中执行任意脚本，窃取会话 Cookie、执行未授权操作或篡改页面内容。攻击者需具备 WordPress 后台登录权限，利用难度较低，影响运行该插件的所有 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18527"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-20T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:02Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress pagination 插件升级至 1.0.7 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 管理后台禁用该插件，并检查所有用户提交内容中是否已存在恶意脚本注入。同时建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加针对 XSS 的过滤规则，对 URL 参数和表单输入中的 `<script>`、`onerror` 等关键字进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/pagination/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18527.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18527.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18527.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18527.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18527.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18527.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/b