者可窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或进行钓鱼攻击，危害网站用户数据安全。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18542"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-16T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:13:03Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 zendesk-help-center 插件升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本。该版本已修复多处跨站脚本漏洞。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件，并通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）添加规则过滤 `zendesk-help-center` 相关 URL 中的可疑参数，防止 XSS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/zendesk-help-center/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18542.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18542.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18542.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18542.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18542.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18542.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/CVE-2017-18542.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18542.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18542-zendesk_help_center-f5ec709c-c67d-4067-a118-166e104d148a.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18542.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18542.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0067","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18487","title":"WordPress Google AdSense插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Google AdSense 插件（adsense-plugin）1.44 版本之前存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件未能对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理，导致攻击者可在页面中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码。当管理员或其他用户访问受影响的页面时，恶意脚本会在浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。攻击者无需身份认证即可发起攻击，但需要诱导用户点击恶意链接或访问特制页面，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18487"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-13T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:56Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 Google AdSense 插件（adsense-plugin）升级至 1.44 或更高版本。该版本修复了多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用该插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）添加规则过滤恶意脚本注入请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/adsense-plugin/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18487.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18487.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18487.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18487.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18487.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18487.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2017-18487.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18487-adsense_plugin-4fc8deda-9fb3-41e5-850b-5109d4018027.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18487.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18487.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18487.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0073","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18496","title":"WordPress htaccess插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress htaccess 插件 1.7.6 之前版本存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件未对用户输入进行充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可利用特制请求将恶意 JavaScript 代码注入到受影响页面中。当管理员或其他用户访问被注入的页面时，恶意脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击者需诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问特制页面，无需身份认证即可触发，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18496"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-13T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:58Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 htaccess 插件升级到 1.7.6 或更高版本。登录 WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 已安装插件 → 找到 Htaccess by BestWebSoft → 点击「更新」。如已禁用自动更新，请手动从 wordpress.org/plugins/htaccess/ 下载最新版覆盖安装。作为临时缓解措施，可限制 wp-admin 目录的访问权限或移除未使用的管理员账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/htaccess/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18496.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18496.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18496.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18496.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18496.json","