ves/2017/CVE-2017-18494.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18494.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18494.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18494.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18494.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18494.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2017-18494.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18494.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-18494.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18494.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-2017-18494-custom_search_plugin-711a7307-0a7a-4640-8d88-5c370b0156de.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0071","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18493","title":"WordPress custom-admin-page插件 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 custom-admin-page 插件（BestWebSoft 开发）0.1.2 之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件对用户输入的 category 参数缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理，导致攻击者可在 admin.php?page=bws_panel 页面中注入恶意脚本。已登录认证的攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 诱使管理员点击，从而在受害者浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，可能导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取或后台恶意操作。攻击者无需提升权限，但需受害者交互触发。升级至 0.1.2 及以上版本即可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,