c/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0070","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18492","title":"WordPress contact-form-to-db 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 contact-form-to-db 插件（版本低于 1.5.7）存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件未对用户输入的数据进行充分过滤和转义，导致攻击者可通过向表单字段中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或其他用户查看已提交的表单数据时触发执行。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问特制页面即可实施攻击，可导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改。该漏洞影响所有使用 contact-form-to-db 插件且版本低于 1.5.7 的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18492"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-13T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:57Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 contact-form-to-db 插件升级至 1.5.7 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）添加规则拦截包含恶意脚本的 POST 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-to-db/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18492.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18492.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18492.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18492.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18492.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-18492.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2017-18492.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-18492.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2017/CVE-201